    "updated_at": "2023-10-03T15:16:05Z",
    "body": "As someone who's currently using a codespace to contribute to this repo, this would be super handy. Especially combined with some VSCode tasks to quickly launch build and test tasks. I came looking to see if someone already suggested this.\r\n\r\nI've been working on similar projects these last few weeks and I'd be happy to help. You can totally include target tools @chipbuster . You can even include recommended extensions. Devcontainers are such an underutilized feature that can really help increase the quality and participation of folks in the community.",
